@startuml
title 第一里程碑组件图（UML-COMP-M1-001）
left to right direction
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam componentStyle rectangle

actor "需求方" as User

node "用户浏览器" as Browser {
  component "对话 + 行为图 + 节点详情" as UI
}

node "宿主机本地进程" as Host {
  component "HTTP 层" as Http
  component "需求协调" as Requirement
  component "统一图校验与哈希" as Validator
  component "Codex 运行器" as CodexRunner
  component "Git Worktree 管理" as GitRunner
  component "交互图投影" as Graph
  database "SQLite" as Db
}

component "已登录的本机 Codex CLI" as Codex
component "固定 git 命令" as Git
component "固定 dot 命令" as Dot
folder "目标 Git 仓库\n建模时只读" as Repository
folder "本次隔离 Worktree\n实现时可写" as Worktree
file "批准的统一图\n规范化 JSON + SHA-256" as ApprovedModel

User --> UI
UI --> Http : 三个 JSON API + 一个 SVG 投影接口
Http --> Requirement
Requirement --> Validator
Requirement --> Db
Requirement --> CodexRunner
Requirement --> GitRunner : 仅批准事务提交后
Requirement --> Graph
CodexRunner --> Codex : 固定参数数组，无 shell
Codex --> Repository : 建模：read-only
Codex --> Worktree : 开发：workspace-write
GitRunner --> Git : 固定 worktree add
Git --> Repository
Git --> Worktree
Graph --> Dot : 固定 -Tsvg
Validator --> ApprovedModel : 批准后不可变
CodexRunner --> ApprovedModel : 原文与哈希作为开发输入

note bottom of Host
只监听本机；同一需求一次只运行一个 AI 调用。
不保存或传递 Codex 登录凭证。
end note

note bottom of CodexRunner
第一版直接适配 Codex CLI。
不预建 OpenAI、Anthropic 或多 Provider 抽象。
end note
@enduml
